WEBVTT

00:06:28.246 --> 00:06:31.163
following gamma wave stimulation.

00:06:31.829 --> 00:06:35.829
We've also seen that the blood
vessels in the brain

00:06:35.871 --> 00:06:38.288
respond to the stimulation.

00:06:38.746 --> 00:06:44.454
These vessels widen their diameters
to increase blood flow, for instance.

00:06:45.496 --> 00:06:50.121
This improved circulation
may play a key role

00:06:50.121 --> 00:06:52.746
in flushing out waste as well.

00:06:54.579 --> 00:06:57.204
So, mice are nice.

00:06:58.329 --> 00:07:00.329
But people are the point.